ry and PRN use is limited.","category":"Pharmacy Service Deficiencies","concept":"medication","concept_label":"Medication management"},"cms-f0761":{"code":"F-0761","title":"Ensure drugs and biologicals used in the facility are labeled in accordance with currently accepted professional principles; and all drugs and biologicals must be stored in locked compartments, separately locked, compartments for controlled drugs.","category":"Pharmacy Service Deficiencies","concept":"medication","concept_label":"Medication management"},"cms-f0881":{"code":"F-0881","title":"Implement a program that monitors antibiotic use.","category":"Infection Control Deficiencies","concept":"infection_prevention","concept_label":"Infection prevention"},"cms-f0732":{"code":"F-0732","title":"Post nurse staffing information every day.","category":"Nursing and Physician Services Deficiencies","concept":"staffing","concept_label":"Staffing & supervision"},"cms-f0689":{"code":"F-0689","title":"Ensure that a nursing home area is free from accident hazards and provides adequate supervision to prevent accidents.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-e0041":{"code":"E-0041","title":"Implement emergency and standby power systems.","category":"Emergency Preparedness Deficiencies","concept":"emergency_preparedness","concept_label":"Emergency preparedness"},"cms-k0521":{"code":"K-0521","title":"Ensure heating and ventilation systems that have been properly installed according to the manufacturer's instructions.","category":"Services Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0355":{"code":"K-0355","title":"Properly select, install, inspect, or maintain portable fire extinguishes.","category":"Smoke Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-f0572":{"code":"F-0572","title":"Give residents a notice of rights, rules, ser